{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A homeland defense adventure to raise and fight kawaii annihilation weapons!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handheld annihilation weapons to defeat invading enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/96cfa5f7ed7f8c0438b4f1d0226d8e00.poster.avif?t=1770713293\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/96cfa5f7ed7f8c0438b4f1d0226d8e00.webm?t=1770713293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/96cfa5f7ed7f8c0438b4f1d0226d8e00.mp4?t=1770713293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold MOCHI-O in your right hand, aim at the enemy, and attack. Enemies you defeat will drop seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you accumulate experience gained from picking up the seeds, you will gain skills from random choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your MOCHI-O in battle to destroy the approaching enemies and defend the defense line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throwing Seeds to Breed MOCHI-O</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/515cd08e81b42ceab240ff6f68461331.poster.avif?t=1770713293\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/515cd08e81b42ceab240ff6f68461331.webm?t=1770713293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/515cd08e81b42ceab240ff6f68461331.mp4?t=1770713293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the money you earn in battle to strengthen MOCHI-O.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also unlock weapons, which will give you an advantage in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giving seeds to MOCHI-O will increase its trust level and strengthen its status.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is MOCHI-O?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/1e6be370013baacf516366bc006394c0.poster.avif?t=1770713293\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/1e6be370013baacf516366bc006394c0.webm?t=1770713293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/1e6be370013baacf516366bc006394c0.mp4?t=1770713293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute hamster......but a handy annihilation weapon for homeland defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's mission is to raise MOCHI-O as a keeper and protect his country from foreign enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heartwarming dialogue between the characters is also a highlight of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creator Profile</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/1216e43dcc9c137ebe02b5ce9d93ba72.avif?t=1770713293\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zxima</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zxima started game development as an independent developer in 2017,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has released 10 games, including \u201cParasite Days\u201d and \u201cPost-apocalypse Bakery\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His games are set in a tender post-apocalypse world, and feature game systems and a mysterious worldview created by his unique sensibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cCatastrophe Restaurant\u201d won the Top 3 award at the Google Play Indie Games Festival 2022.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Creator's comment]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wouldn't it be great if you could go on a rampage with a small, cute, and extremely strong character?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's what I had in mind when I created this game from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I would be happy if you could go on a rampage with a small, cute, and extremely strong character.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New zookeeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596670/f279a06eeeafea65adb766f9e980a7a9003700f9.jpg"},{"name":"Normal mode clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596670/f279a06eeeafea65adb766f9e980a7a9003700f9.jpg"},{"name":"Hard mode clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596670/f279a06eeeafea65adb766f9e980a7a9003700f9.jpg"},{"name":"Endless mode level10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3596670/f279a06eeeafea65adb766f9e980a7a9003700f9.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3596670?t=1770713293","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/e037095ab466f2b5a28dbad55d0725698e3de3bf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770713293","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/1f2411159261fe5629fcc99004bf3795619d0508/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770713293","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/1f2411159261fe5629fcc99004bf3795619d0508/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770713293","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descriptio