6670/extras/515cd08e81b42ceab240ff6f68461331.mp4?t=1770713293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the money you earn in battle to strengthen MOCHI-O.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also unlock weapons, which will give you an advantage in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giving seeds to MOCHI-O will increase its trust level and strengthen its status.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is MOCHI-O?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/1e6be370013baacf516366bc006394c0.poster.avif?t=1770713293\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/1e6be370013baacf516366bc006394c0.webm?t=1770713293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/1e6be370013baacf516366bc006394c0.mp4?t=1770713293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute hamster......but a handy annihilation weapon for homeland defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's mission is to raise MOCHI-O as a keeper and protect his country from foreign enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heartwarming dialogue between the characters is also a highlight of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creator Profile</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/extras/1216e43dcc9c137ebe02b5ce9d93ba72.avif?t=1770713293\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zxima</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zxima started game development as an independent developer in 2017,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has released 10 games, including \u201cParasite Days\u201d and \u201cPost-apocalypse Bakery\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His games are set in a tender post-apocalypse world, and feature game systems and a mysterious worldview created by his unique sensibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cCatastrophe Restaurant\u201d won the Top 3 award at the Google Play Indie Games Festival 2022.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Creator's comment]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wouldn't it be great if you could go on a rampage with a small, cute, and extremely strong character?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's what I had in mind when I created this game from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I would be happy if you could go on a rampage with a small, cute, and extremely strong character.</p>","developers":["Zxima"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596670/a7c61ff8c13e7a9720674b613f9835e3b89b2000/header.jpg?t=1770713293","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3596670/389807741/705062295f7db6bd87369deedaa56b8b3b121358/1767755684/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767756224","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3596670/389807741/705062295f7db6bd87369deedaa56b8b3b121358/1767755684/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767756224","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3596670/389807741/705062295f7db6bd87369deedaa56b8b3b121358/1767755684/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767756224","id":257260889,"name":"mochio_2ndtrailer_en","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_